"how can I look like Stormi?"

565
00:28:21,207 --> 00:28:25,358
That's why people want to listen to
what she has to say.

566
00:28:25,358 --> 00:28:27,668
[A beauty icon to look up to, Stormi]

567
00:28:27,668 --> 00:28:31,770
Hi, I'm Stormi Bree of Team USA
on X THE LEAGUE.

568
00:28:31,770 --> 00:28:35,042
I'm a model, a musician, and an actress.

569
00:28:35,042 --> 00:28:37,727
I started modeling when I was 17 years old.

570
00:28:37,727 --> 00:28:41,652
I won the Miss Teen USA competition
that my mom entered me in.

571
00:28:41,652 --> 00:28:44,585
She didn't ask me, but I accidentally won it.

572
00:28:44,585 --> 00:28:50,774
[Stormi Bree winning Miss Teen USA 2009]
Miss Teen USA 2009 is Tennessee.

573
00:28:50,774 --> 00:28:53,828
I did a lot of modeling after that.

574
00:28:53,828 --> 00:28:57,690
[Stormi is active in fashion and beauty]
I've done a lot of fashion and beauty modeling.

575
00:28:57,690 --> 00:29:00,274
Because I'm on X THE LEAGUE and I'm a model,

576
00:29:00,274 --> 00:29:05,184
I'll use this photoshoot as a way to get some
high-quality shots and incorporate the product.

577
00:29:05,184 --> 00:29:06,881
Here we go.

578
00:29:06,881 --> 00:29:09,483
[Stormi highlighting the product with modeling]

579
00:29:09,483 --> 00:29:11,879
Pretty. Love that.

580
00:29:11,879 --> 00:29:14,897
[Distinctive model aura]
Yeah. Yes.

581
00:29:14,897 --> 00:29:16,152
Love that.

582
00:29:16,152 --> 00:29:20,607
I incorporate the product into my lifestyle
and show them.

583
00:29:20,607 --> 00:29:25,493
When I give them the perspective
that I actually chose the products that I love,

584
00:29:25,493 --> 00:29:27,658
I think my fans can feel that.

585
00:29:28,269 --> 00:29:31,826
[The key is content that naturally blends
into everyday life]

586
00:29:32,531 --> 00:29:35,537
[What content will capture Stormi's life?]

587
00:29:38,467 --> 00:29:43,000
