588
00:29:43,000 --> 00:29:45,034
Olive oil and lemon juice.

589
00:29:45,034 --> 00:29:46,668
Francesca and I do that every day.

590
00:29:46,668 --> 00:29:49,401
I juice a lemon and add olive oil.

591
00:29:49,401 --> 00:29:54,653
I dirty two cups just to make this.

592
00:29:54,653 --> 00:29:57,267
I already have a pile of dishes
before my day even starts.

593
00:29:57,267 --> 00:29:58,936
So I would probably show...

594
00:29:58,936 --> 00:30:01,833
[Turning inconvenience into content]
I do this every day.

595
00:30:01,833 --> 00:30:05,467
Then let's time how long my routine takes.

596
00:30:05,467 --> 00:30:08,700
I have an olive lemon shot every morning.

597
00:30:08,700 --> 00:30:09,802
Time starts now.

598
00:30:09,802 --> 00:30:10,936
[Timing exactly how long it takes]

599
00:30:10,936 --> 00:30:13,172
Wash it really quick.

600
00:30:13,172 --> 00:30:15,441
[Starting with washing the lemon]

601
00:30:15,441 --> 00:30:17,190
[Stormi shows her routine as is]

602
00:30:18,934 --> 00:30:20,946
That's probably enough.

603
00:30:20,946 --> 00:30:26,518
I don't like using too much olive oil,
but it cuts the lemon's tartness.

604
00:30:28,654 --> 00:30:31,267
[Downed in seconds after all that prep]

605
00:30:31,267 --> 00:30:33,059
Now...

606
00:30:33,059 --> 00:30:34,700
