Clean the lemons up. Put everything back.

609
00:30:39,865 --> 00:30:42,434
[More work than you'd expect for one shot]

610
00:30:42,434 --> 00:30:44,570
Time stops now.

611
00:30:44,570 --> 00:30:45,967
[How long including cleanup?]

612
00:30:45,967 --> 00:30:49,134
[Total time: 1 min 29 sec]
A minute 30. That's going really quickly.

613
00:30:49,134 --> 00:30:50,876
Or...

614
00:30:50,876 --> 00:30:53,745
This is my favorite find in Korea.

615
00:30:54,380 --> 00:30:56,748
Let's time this one too.

616
00:31:01,989 --> 00:31:03,055
Time stops now.

617
00:31:03,055 --> 00:31:04,190
[Timer stopped]

618
00:31:04,190 --> 00:31:06,425
11 seconds.

619
00:31:06,425 --> 00:31:07,460
See?

620
00:31:07,460 --> 00:31:10,496
So much easier.
This is my favorite thing I've found.

621
00:31:10,496 --> 00:31:12,731
I love a lot
of the other face products and stuff,

622
00:31:12,731 --> 00:31:15,234
[Showing the convenience with a real test]
but this is my number one favorite.

623
00:31:15,868 --> 00:31:20,838
[Stormi backs it up with exact timing]

624
00:31:24,967 --> 00:31:26,545
[After posting authentic content]
I'm doing my lemon and olive oil shot

625
00:31:26,545 --> 00:31:27,546
