little by little.

629
00:31:36,255 --> 00:31:38,467
I'm aiming to finish second
or higher in Round 1.

630
00:31:38,467 --> 00:31:41,034
I want to reach the X1 Diamond tier.

631
00:31:41,034 --> 00:31:44,063
We're working hard on our next move.

632
00:31:44,063 --> 00:31:46,334
Today we're using a gifting strategy.

633
00:31:46,334 --> 00:31:47,466
[Team USA's comeback plan: gifting]
We didn't do this the first time,

634
00:31:47,466 --> 00:31:49,435
