635
00:31:49,435 --> 00:31:51,967
[Stormi meets up for the gifting strategy]

636
00:31:51,967 --> 00:31:55,133
[With Team USA captain Kade]

637
00:31:55,133 --> 00:31:56,767
What matters most right now is

638
00:31:56,767 --> 00:31:59,411
