639
00:31:59,411 --> 00:32:01,480
So today, we're putting
our gifting strategy into action.

640
00:32:01,480 --> 00:32:04,083
We're putting the products

641
00:32:04,083 --> 00:32:09,155
[Inviting major influencers to try products]
