645
00:32:16,629 --> 00:32:19,165
[Influencers with massive followings]

646
00:32:19,165 --> 00:32:21,434
[Guests start arriving]

647
00:32:21,434 --> 00:32:24,267
So I invited all kinds of people today.

648
00:32:24,267 --> 00:32:26,234
I thought it would be cool.

649
00:32:26,234 --> 00:32:30,476
I think we should work this
into the table setting.

650
00:32:30,476 --> 00:32:32,601
It goes well with the lemons.

651
00:32:32,601 --> 00:32:35,915
[They start by setting the table themselves]
We could work it into the center of the table.

652
00:32:35,915 --> 00:32:41,601
[And prepare food for the guests]

653
00:32:41,601 --> 00:32:45,201
Thank you so much for coming, everyone.

654
00:32:45,201 --> 00:32:46,659
We're all here tonight

655
00:32:46,659 --> 00:32:49,395
because we have some great products
to show you.

656
00:32:49,395 --> 00:32:51,530
Try these amazing Korean products.

657
00:32:51,530 --> 00:32:55,036
We handpicked them in Korea.

658
00:32:55,036 --> 00:32:57,336
How about we start with the appetizer?

659
00:32:57,336 --> 00:33:00,973
[Olive lemon shots at every place setting]
This is an olive oil and lemon juice shot.

660
00:33:00,973 --> 00:33:02,934
My favorite.

661
00:33:02,934 --> 00:33:04,510
