662
00:33:04,510 --> 00:33:08,000
I like how the olive oil gives it more body.

663
00:33:08,000 --> 00:33:09,014
Cheers.

664
00:33:09,014 --> 00:33:11,688
[Product promotion blends right into dinner]

665
00:33:14,954 --> 00:33:17,389
[Naturally trying the products]
In Italian, that means "to the throat."

666
00:33:18,192 --> 00:33:20,234
- Period.
- Period.

667
00:33:20,234 --> 00:33:22,294
It's pleasantly refreshing.

668
00:33:22,294 --> 00:33:25,333
Yeah, I think the lemon gives it that kick.

669
00:33:25,333 --> 00:33:27,833
- Someone try it.
- I want to try that.

670
00:33:29,802 --> 00:33:32,506
[Starting dinner on a refreshing note]

671
00:33:32,506 --> 00:33:35,733
You know we have so many products,
and this is one of them.

672
00:33:35,733 --> 00:33:38,568
[Secret weapon No. 1]
This was one of my favorites before.

673
00:33:38,568 --> 00:33:40,479
[The product pitch keeps flowing naturally]
Yes. It's so good.

674
00:33:40,479 --> 00:33:43,760
Camella, I actually sold them all
to my friends.

675
00:33:43,760 --> 00:33:44,792
- Really?
- Yeah.

676
00:33:44,792 --> 00:33:46,885
They all told me how much they loved it.

677
00:33:46,885 --> 00:33:49,752
[Interest rises with strong recommendations]

678
00:33:50,889 --> 00:33:56,833
[Team USA products posted on social media]

679
00:33:56,833 --> 00:34:02,203
At the end of the day, this show is
about which country sells the most.

680
00:34:02,203 --> 00:34:07,640
We need your help to move up even one spot.

681
00:34:07,640 --> 00:34:11,577
If we can pull off the promotions, events,
and collaborations we're planning,

682
00:34:11,577 --> 00:34:15,100
