683
00:34:15,100 --> 00:34:17,823
Let's have one last toast to Team USA.

684
00:34:17,823 --> 00:34:20,134
[Team USA's new gifting strategy] - USA!
- USA!

685
00:34:20,134 --> 00:34:22,020
[Building trust through repeated exposure]

686
00:34:26,067 --> 00:34:28,661
Literally, we have one more left.

687
00:34:28,661 --> 00:34:31,334
When Round 1 is over,

688
00:34:31,334 --> 00:34:34,300
