689
00:34:34,300 --> 00:34:37,236
In Korea, they're all
about eating their skincare.

690
00:34:37,236 --> 00:34:40,339
[Can Team USA make a comeback?]

691
00:34:40,339 --> 00:34:43,978
[Japan]

692
00:34:43,978 --> 00:34:46,111
[Another country near the bottom]

693
00:34:46,111 --> 00:34:49,114
Seventh place goes to Japan.

694
00:34:50,549 --> 00:34:52,751
[Japan ranks seventh at Round 1 midpoint]

695
00:34:54,420 --> 00:35:00,261
