699
00:35:07,166 --> 00:35:09,626
[Top teams have over 1 billion won in sales]

700
00:35:10,836 --> 00:35:13,301
[Other countries' sales exceed expectations]

701
00:35:13,301 --> 00:35:15,634
So this is where things stand.

702
00:35:15,634 --> 00:35:18,711
But up to the midpoint,

703
00:35:18,711 --> 00:35:22,214
