710
00:35:40,767 --> 00:35:43,700
Our followers are totally different, too.

711
00:35:43,700 --> 00:35:45,504
Same here.

712
00:35:45,504 --> 00:35:52,111
I normally don't post much
besides our own products,

713
00:35:52,111 --> 00:35:54,513
