In Japan,
when you label a product post as an ad,

716
00:36:01,501 --> 00:36:05,457
the ad label itself still turns people off.

717
00:36:05,457 --> 00:36:07,559
[A Gyaru icon of J-beauty]
So bridging the gap

718
00:36:07,559 --> 00:36:10,508
between the promotions we want to do

719
00:36:10,508 --> 00:36:16,068
and what fans and the public expect in Japan
is still difficult.

720
00:36:16,068 --> 00:36:20,508
[A tough wall in Japan's conservative market]

721
00:36:20,508 --> 00:36:25,077
And on Sana's livestream,
viewers can't buy right away.

722
00:36:25,077 --> 00:36:27,479
Unlike on TikTok Shop.

723
00:36:28,080 --> 00:36:32,184
In Japan, livestream commerce still
isn't the norm.

724
00:36:32,184 --> 00:36:37,156
Instagram Stories are
still the main way to sell.

725
00:36:37,156 --> 00:36:39,634
I'd say 80 to 90% is still

726
00:36:39,634 --> 00:36:43,387
[Sana's Instagram short-form videos]
short-form content or Instagram Stories.

727
00:36:43,387 --> 00:36:46,867
About 10% use TikTok Live

728
00:36:46,867 --> 00:36:50,269
[One billion won monthly sales]
or Instagram Live,

729
00:36:50,269 --> 00:36:53,407
but TikTok Live is only just getting started.

730
00:36:53,407 --> 00:36:55,407
Do you usually use TikTok or Instagram more?

731
00:36:55,407 --> 00:36:56,867
Instagram for me.

732
00:36:56,867 --> 00:36:58,367
[Team Instagram]
Instagram?

733
00:36:58,367 --> 00:37:01,013
You're definitely more
of a TikTok person, right?

734
00:37:01,013 --> 00:37:02,733
[Even the office is split on SNS preferences]
It really is split.

735
00:37:02,733 --> 00:37:05,484
Sana, your company is looking
to shift toward TikTok too, right?

736
00:37:05,484 --> 00:37:07,800
[Sana considers trying a new platform]

737
00:37:07,800 --> 00:37:09,334
I do think it'd be good.

738
00:37:09,334 --> 00:37:12,524
I recently came back to TikTok too.

739
00:37:12,524 --> 00:37:15,634
I posted about four days ago.

740
00:37:15,634 --> 00:37:20,867
Maybe because it'd been a while since I posted,
I gained about 4,000 followers.

741
00:37:20,867 --> 00:37:23,202
Really? That's fast.

742
00:37:23,202 --> 00:37:25,871
I was on Instagram about 95% of the time too.

743
00:37:25,871 --> 00:37:28,740
But this year,
I thought I'd give TikTok a try too,

744
00:37:28,740 --> 00:37:33,881
so I posted there again last week.

745
00:37:33,881 --> 00:37:39,387
I posted for the first time in a while,
and it already got about 850,000 views,

746
00:37:39,387 --> 00:37:41,833
[Now over 1 million views]
and I gained about 4,000 followers too.

747
00:37:41,833 --> 00:37:44,634
So much changed in just one day

748
00:37:44,634 --> 00:37:47,659
that I thought TikTok Live
might be worth trying.

749
00:37:47,659 --> 00:37:50,496
[A bold shift from her old style to TikTok]

750
00:37:50,496 --> 00:37:51,967
All right, shall we start?

751
00:37:51,967 --> 00:37:53,732
First, while saying something...

752
00:37:53,732 --> 00:37:55,534
Let's try to get to around 200 viewers.

753
00:37:55,534 --> 00:37:56,404
[Casually chatting while pitching products]

754
00:37:56,404 --> 00:37:59,304
Can you see the comments?

755
00:38:00,272 --> 00:38:03,341
[Everything's ready, and the livestream begins]

756
00:38:04,109 --> 00:38:06,411
[Viewers climb from the moment it starts]

757
00:38:06,411 --> 00:38:08,647
I've started posting
on TikTok again after a long break,

758
00:38:08,647 --> 00:38:10,782
so please leave lots of comments.

759
00:38:10,782 --> 00:38:12,967
[Sana eases in with casual conversation]

760
00:38:12,967 --> 00:38:17,422
Did you know I produce my own corsets?

761
00:38:17,422 --> 00:38:18,590
This is it.

762
00:38:18,590 --> 00:38:24,540
[Straight into the product pitch]

763
00:38:25,334 --> 00:38:28,633
It comes in five sizes.

764
00:38:36,108 --> 00:38:37,175
Wait.

765
00:38:37,175 --> 00:38:39,011
My fly was open.

766
00:38:39,011 --> 00:38:41,246
[Runs away]

767
00:38:42,733 --> 00:38:46,167
[Zipper check]

768
00:38:46,167 --> 00:38:48,301
[One billion won monthly sales]
I was so embarrassed.

769
00:38:48,301 --> 00:38:51,924
My fly was open.

770
00:38:51,924 --> 00:38:56,361
[Zipper exposed: public apology]

771
00:38:56,361 --> 00:38:58,397
I had my fly wide open
in front of 1,000 people.

772
00:38:58,397 --> 00:39:00,065
[Over 1,000 viewers]

773
00:39:00,065 --> 00:39:02,900
[Back to selling after the zipper fix]

774
00:39:02,900 --> 00:39:05,337
I used to be a man, you know.

775
00:39:05,337 --> 00:39:09,234
So I don't have much of a waistline.

776
00:39:09,234 --> 00:39:12,444
Three, two, one.

777
00:39:12,444 --> 00:39:15,940
[Proving trust by trying it on herself]

778
00:39:16,949 --> 00:39:18,684
[Amazing!] [This is awesome!] [So good!]

779
00:39:18,684 --> 00:39:19,985
[The best]

780
00:39:19,985 --> 00:39:21,219
[So slim]

781
00:39:21,219 --> 00:39:22,487
[Real-time viewer reactions pour in]

782
00:39:22,487 --> 00:39:24,167
They're buying it right away.

783
00:39:25,159 --> 00:39:27,926
We're already at 1,300 viewers.

784
00:39:27,926 --> 00:39:29,962
[6.5x the target, far beyond expectations]

785
00:39:29,962 --> 00:39:32,800
Today was my first chance

786
00:39:32,800 --> 00:39:37,502
to show the corset I make on TikTok Live.

787
00:39:38,303 --> 00:39:39,471
[New highs in rank and viewer count]

788
00:39:39,471 --> 00:39:42,568
[Upward surge] [About 1,600 more viewers]

789
00:39:42,568 --> 00:39:44,876
After streaming for an hour,

790
00:39:44,876 --> 00:39:47,668
I sold more than I did
during the sales evaluation.

791
00:39:47,668 --> 00:39:52,684
I realized TikTok works
better than Instagram in Japan too,

792
00:39:52,684 --> 00:39:56,655
so I'm going to focus more on TikTok.

793
00:39:56,655 --> 00:40:01,226
If I share these TikTok results
with the Japan team,

794
00:40:01,226 --> 00:40:06,831
I think it could spark a big change.

795
00:40:08,767 --> 00:40:15,667
[Team Japan makes its final push]

796
00:40:16,341 --> 00:40:19,444
I realized how big the gap is
between us and the other countries,

797
00:40:19,444 --> 00:40:22,900
but I think we still have
plenty of room to grow.

798
00:40:22,900 --> 00:40:26,485
I don't think we need to rush
as long as we win in the end.

799
00:40:26,485 --> 00:40:28,081
[Round 1 ends]

800
00:40:31,089 --> 00:40:33,792
[Which country takes No. 1 in Round 1?]

801
00:40:33,792 --> 00:40:36,967
[Team China was third at midpoint]

802
00:40:36,967 --> 00:40:38,664
You two are in Korea, right?

803
00:40:38,664 --> 00:40:40,399
[Cui Shishi & Guo Qing, both based in Korea]

804
00:40:40,399 --> 00:40:42,336
<i>You're in Beijing.</i>

805
00:40:42,336 --> 00:40:44,305
<i>I'm so jealous you two are together.</i>

806
00:40:44,305 --> 00:40:49,800
