808
00:40:52,179 --> 00:40:53,211
I'm so nervous.

809
00:40:53,211 --> 00:40:55,947
Team China has to be first, right?

810
00:40:55,947 --> 00:40:57,749
I believe we will.

811
00:40:57,749 --> 00:41:01,000
<i>Right. I thought we were in first
