[Team USA was 8th in the interim rankings]

825
00:41:34,867 --> 00:41:36,421
No.

826
00:41:37,668 --> 00:41:39,624
There's no way.

827
00:41:39,624 --> 00:41:44,464
The result itself isn't great, of course,

828
00:41:44,464 --> 00:41:46,732
