830
00:41:49,767 --> 00:41:51,733
[Team Korea was 2nd in interim rankings]
I'm nervous.

831
00:41:51,733 --> 00:41:53,171
I couldn't sleep.

832
00:41:53,767 --> 00:41:56,274
- I was...
- You look like you slept the best.

833
00:41:56,274 --> 00:41:57,167
No.

834
00:41:57,167 --> 00:41:59,247
[Team Korea was too nervous to sleep]
You look well-rested.

835
00:41:59,247 --> 00:42:01,346
I couldn't sleep.

836
00:42:01,346 --> 00:42:03,134
I really hoped we'd stay in the top two.

837
00:42:03,134 --> 00:42:04,216
I prayed.

838
00:42:04,216 --> 00:42:06,067
[Team Japan was 7th in interim rankings]

839
00:42:06,067 --> 00:42:10,655
Here are the final Round 1 results.

840
00:42:12,724 --> 00:42:16,962
