843
00:42:24,736 --> 00:42:28,173
[Team Thailand was 5th in interim rankings]

844
00:42:28,173 --> 00:42:31,376
I'm so nervous.

845
00:42:31,376 --> 00:42:35,781
Let's see how Team Thailand does.

846
00:42:35,781 --> 00:42:38,100
[Team Indonesia was 1st in interim rankings]

847
00:42:38,100 --> 00:42:41,386
I think I'm going to be so nervous.

848
00:42:41,386 --> 00:42:43,248
[Nervous]

849
00:42:46,301 --> 00:42:49,427
Hello, we're your X THE LEAGUE hosts,
Tiffany Young.

850
00:42:49,427 --> 00:42:50,867
And BamBam.

851
00:42:50,867 --> 00:42:52,364
The international commerce competition,

852
00:42:52,364 --> 00:42:54,267
