868
00:43:48,553 --> 00:43:51,389
I'm so nervous my palms are sweating.

869
00:43:52,234 --> 00:43:55,767
[China was 3rd. Where will they finish?]

870
00:43:55,767 --> 00:43:57,262
Third place is...

871
00:43:59,865 --> 00:44:06,000
