873
00:44:10,342 --> 00:44:13,745
[Round 1: Singapore & Malaysia finish 3rd]
Malaysia!

874
00:44:13,745 --> 00:44:16,867
[Up one spot from 4th in interim rankings]

875
00:44:16,867 --> 00:44:19,951
Guys, we're third!

876
00:44:20,652 --> 00:44:24,134
