904
00:45:48,167 --> 00:45:49,774
Really?

905
00:45:49,774 --> 00:45:52,610
I think I was really disappointed.

906
00:45:52,610 --> 00:45:55,213
Round 1 was so hard.

907
00:45:55,213 --> 00:45:58,883
[Team Korea falls from 2nd to 4th]

908
00:45:58,883 --> 00:46:00,986
I felt like crying.

909
00:46:00,986 --> 00:46:05,857
I still had hope,
but when we suddenly dropped to fourth,

910
00:46:05,857 --> 00:46:08,926
