because I didn't expect it.

911
00:46:09,527 --> 00:46:11,229
We got too comfortable.

912
00:46:11,229 --> 00:46:13,301
[Team Korea ends Round 1 in 4th]

913
00:46:13,301 --> 00:46:15,633
Team Korea dropped out of second place.

914
00:46:15,633 --> 00:46:19,568
[Team Korea's unexpected drop]

915
00:46:19,568 --> 00:46:22,167
