923
00:46:44,362 --> 00:46:48,427
[About 2.4B, 2.3B, 100M won]
[Big sales gap starting at 5th]

924
00:46:49,070 --> 00:46:51,202
Now for sixth place.

925
00:46:52,867 --> 00:46:54,839
Come on.

926
00:46:55,843 --> 00:46:57,208
Okay. Come on.

927
00:46:57,208 --> 00:47:01,115
[Which country finished 6th?]

928
00:47:03,034 --> 00:47:05,817
Sixth place is Thailand.

929
00:47:07,552 --> 00:47:09,857
Thailand's final Round 1 sales

930
00:47:09,857 --> 00:47:14,492
