931
00:47:14,492 --> 00:47:20,498
[Round 1: Team Thailand finishes 6th]

932
00:47:20,498 --> 00:47:23,601
Thailand ranked below Vietnam, right?

933
00:47:25,470 --> 00:47:27,034
[Team USA was 8th and uneasy]

934
00:47:27,034 --> 00:47:29,006
Oh, my gosh.

935
00:47:30,742 --> 00:47:33,044
Next is seventh place.

936
00:47:34,946 --> 00:47:37,615
[4th, 5th, 6th, 3rd]

937
00:47:37,615 --> 00:47:41,486
[China, Indonesia, USA, Japan:
