939
00:47:43,833 --> 00:47:44,956
Okay.

940
00:47:44,956 --> 00:47:48,099
[The tense seventh-place reveal]

941
00:47:49,833 --> 00:47:51,796
We're still first, right?

942
00:47:52,934 --> 00:47:58,114
[Team Japan was 7th in interim rankings]

943
00:47:59,267 --> 00:48:00,771
Seventh place is...

944
00:48:01,606 --> 00:48:03,308
the USA.

945
00:48:03,308 --> 00:48:06,044
Team USA's final Round 1 sales

946
00:48:06,044 --> 00:48:10,949
