947
00:48:10,949 --> 00:48:12,501
[Round 1: Team USA finishes 7th]

948
00:48:12,501 --> 00:48:14,285
Okay.

949
00:48:14,285 --> 00:48:15,900
Okay.

950
00:48:15,900 --> 00:48:17,391
