951
00:48:17,391 --> 00:48:19,090
[Up one spot from 8th to 7th]

952
00:48:19,090 --> 00:48:22,201
[What? Team USA?]

953
00:48:22,201 --> 00:48:24,295
- Oh, my.
- The USA?

954
00:48:24,295 --> 00:48:26,598
