959
00:48:39,410 --> 00:48:42,434
[Round 1: Team Japan finishes 8th]

960
00:48:42,434 --> 00:48:44,482
The gap is that big?

961
00:48:46,584 --> 00:48:51,367
[Silence at the shocking sales gap]

962
00:48:51,367 --> 00:48:52,900
Eight million won?

963
00:48:52,900 --> 00:48:54,659
That's rough.

964
00:48:54,659 --> 00:48:56,928
That's rough. They'd be so sad.

965
00:48:56,928 --> 00:49:00,967
This kind of commerce isn't
as developed in Japan.

966
00:49:00,967 --> 00:49:04,001
